<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3440/45  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5222/27  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7072/77  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2563/68  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.34/38   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1380/00  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1529.4/0.9 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     112.83/88  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.5757/32  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4540/70  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8320/45  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4155/65  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7925/30  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7320/30  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5923/33</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$382.90/383.40</p>
</text>
